          "value": "driver og",
          "lang": "no"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": " is a more colloquial progressive that takes a conjugated verb, not an infinitive, so the structure would need to change. "
        },
        {
          "kind": "foreign_term",
          "value": "sitter og",
          "lang": "no"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": " also takes a conjugated verb and adds the implication of being seated, which does not fit this context."
        }
      ],
